{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50216","headline":"七夕卧病 · 郑愿","name":"七夕卧病","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"玉露三秋早，反河七夕初。\n不应须卧疾，爲曝腹中书。\n（〖1〗郑愿，《新唐书·宰相世系表》载爲郑氏南祖房清河令文睿子，无仕历。\n《郎官石柱题名》其名两见，司勳员外郎在卢象後，李嘉佑前，金部郎中在裴眺、郑楚客间，以诸人时代推，应爲天宝、大历间人。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"郑愿","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_50216.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50216","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}